{
  "_comment": [
    "CANONICAL cross-repo fixtures for the term-yield analysis (§3.5).",
    "",
    "Run through BOTH implementations:",
    "  - MCP app: buildTermYield in server/protocol.ts (tests/unit/term-yield.test.ts)",
    "  - Website: index.html's page-global buildTermYield (verify-parity.mjs)",
    "",
    "BEHAVIOR fixture, hand-written. Each case pins a judgement the analysis makes,",
    "and the wording of those judgements is part of the contract because it reaches",
    "the user in a citable report:",
    "  - ordering is seedCount DESC then label ASC, so two repos agree and reruns are stable",
    "  - a term with 0 seeds is 'uncorroborated', NOT wrong: it came from the",
    "    thesaurus or by hand on purpose",
    "  - a term on exactly 1 seed is 'fragile' — real, but thinly evidenced",
    "  - a seed contributing nothing is reported ('barren'), because it may be indexed",
    "    differently, which is a record the query will struggle to retrieve",
    "  - the balance note names the trade-off (headings = precision, keywords = recall)",
    "    without calling either arrangement an error",
    "",
    "`protocol` is a full SearchProtocol object, the same shape buildSearchProtocol",
    "emits — see protocol-parity.json."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
